OL,3,GNEWSAPolice search for escaped sex
OL,4,Aoffender prisoner
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are searching for a sex offender
OL,7,Fwho escaped from a Lincolnshire prison.
OL,9,FJames Hands was reported missing from
OL,10,FHMP North Sea Camp in Boston on
OL,11,FTuesday.
OL,13,FLincolnshire Police said the
OL,14,F38-year-old, from Nottingham, had
OL,15,Ftattoos on his neck and hands and was
OL,16,Fserving a sentence for stalking and
OL,17,Fharassment.
